 26/03/Screenshot-2026-03-11-at-3.32.43-pm.png
CREATED:20260311T043927Z
DESCRIPTION:Effulgent V takes place on the stolen land of the Ngunnawal an
 d Ngambri people. We pay our respects to Elders past and present. Sovereig
 nty was never ceded and this was\, and always will be Aboriginal land. \n\
 n\n\n𝚐𝚛𝚘𝚞𝚗𝚍 𝚌𝚘𝚗𝚝𝚛𝚘𝚕 𝚝𝚘 𝚖
 𝚊𝚓𝚘𝚛 𝚐𝚊𝚐 – 𝚊 𝚗𝚎𝚠 𝚎𝚏𝚏𝚞𝚕
 𝚐𝚎𝚗𝚝 𝚒𝚜 𝚊𝚋𝚘𝚞𝚝 𝚝𝚘 𝚕𝚊𝚗𝚍
 … \n\n\n\nAfter Earth was struck by a ten-mile Gang Gang sized asteroid\
 , an alien nation was born. The first thing they demanded was a party to s
 hed their old skin and see what this unknown planet has to offer… \n\n\n
 \nYou’re not lost in space right now… Effulgent V is ready for take of
 f! \n\n\n\nThis party will be a fundraiser for our gorgeous friends Rav an
 d Maya for top surgery! Ticket sales will all be going towards them both\,
  if you want to directly donate to them >>> \n\n\n\nRav – https://gofun
 d.me/d9652e9a5Maya – https://tinyurl.com/mayasurgery \n\n\n\nRaffle: \n
 \n\n\nThis time we are also running a raffle to raise some extra cash – 
 if you can’t make the evening you can still be in the running to win som
 e excellent prizes from local legends – prizes TBA! \n\n\n\nAccessibili
 ty: \n\n\n\nEffulgent V is a wheelchair accessible event. \n\n\n\nSmoke ma
 chines will NOT be used. \n\n\n\nStrobing will NOT be used. \n\n\n\nPlease
  bring earplugs if you are sensitive to loud noise\, outdoor space will be
  available. \n\n\n\nFull accessibility and safer spaces policy >>> https
 ://docs.google.com/document/d/1ZPDHZ0gk3ID-5ZztnO5MYsv7Fn2j4q6OAWgbxhmNbdg
 /edit?usp=sharing
LAST-MODIFIED:20260311T043928Z
LOCATION:Gang Gang Cafe\, Shop 4/2 Frencham Pl\, Downer ACT 2602
