BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Butter Sessions 15th Anniversary Party
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260404T160000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Sydney:20260404T230000
DTSTAMP:20260315T133137
UID:ganggang-10001238-1775318400-1775343600@ganggangcafe.com.au
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ganggangcafe.com.au/wp-content/uploads/20
 26/02/Screenshot-2026-02-27-at-1.51.32-pm.png
CREATED:20260227T025302Z
DESCRIPTION:Butter Sessions teams up with Gang Gang to bring you BSRXV Ca
 nberra edition. Clocking 15 years in the game with a trilogy of parties ac
 ross Eastern Australia. \n\n\n\nButter Sessions are bringing a very rare a
 nd heavy line up that Gang Gang has never seen\, and will most likely not 
 see again. Grab a ticket before they are gone. \n\n\n\nLine up: \n\n\n\nSl
 eep D (live) \n\n\n\nKuniyuki (live) (JAP) \n\n\n\nGonno (JAP) \n\n\n\nEmm
 ie \n\n\n\nDana \n\n\n\nGang Gang is committed to an inclusive and safe ex
 perience for all. Gang Gang Cafe is wheelchair accessible with accessible 
 restrooms. We have zero tolerance for harassment and have support measures
  in place to ensure everyone’s safety. For specific accessibility needs 
 or assistance\, please contact us in advance. We aim to make our events en
 joyable for everyone. \n\n\n\nGang Gang Cafe acknowledges the Ngunnawal an
 d Ngambri people\, the Traditional Custodians of the land where our events
  take place. We pay our respects to their Elders past\, present\, and emer
 ging\, and recognise their enduring connection to this land\, waters\, and
  culture. We are grateful to celebrate music and dance on Ngunnawal Countr
 y. Free tickets to all First Nations and Torres Straight Islanders peoples
 \, we just request you contact us for this ticket prior to event.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260227T025303Z
LOCATION:Gang Gang Cafe\, Shop 4/2 Frencham Pl\, Downer ACT 2602
URL:https://ganggangcafe.com.au/event/butter-sessions-15th-anniversary-par
 ty/
END:VEVENT
